<title>USA: OneLink Communications sells program to Norwest.</title>
<headline>OneLink Communications sells program to Norwest.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onelink Communications Inc said Wednesday it installed its InvestorLink communications system at Norwest Corp.</p>
<p>The system allows shareholders, potential investors and broker-dealers to access company news and financial information seven days a week through phone fax and the Internet, OneLink said.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the contract were not announced.</p>
<p>OneLink is a communications technology company.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Wednesday at 1-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
